# Repo

A fictional repository tool with commands nested four levels deep

| | |
|---|---|
| Version | 2.0.0 |

## Commands

- [`repo`](#repo): A fictional repository tool with commands nested four levels deep
  - [`repo remote`](#repo-remote): Manage remotes
    - [`repo remote add`](#repo-remote-add): Add a remote
    - [`repo remote list`](#repo-remote-list): List remotes
    - [`repo remote set-url`](#repo-remote-set-url): Change the URL of a remote
    - [`repo remote branch`](#repo-remote-branch): Manage the branches of a remote
      - [`repo remote branch list`](#repo-remote-branch-list): List the branches of a remote
  - [`repo branch`](#repo-branch): Manage local branches
    - [`repo branch list`](#repo-branch-list): List local branches
    - [`repo branch create`](#repo-branch-create): Create a branch
    - [`repo branch delete`](#repo-branch-delete): Delete branches
  - [`repo config`](#repo-config): Read or write configuration
    - [`repo config edit`](#repo-config-edit): Open the configuration in an editor
  - [`repo sync`](#repo-sync): Synchronise with all remotes

## `repo`

```
repo [options] <command>
```

### Options

| Option | Value | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `--verbose`, `-v` |  | Print more |
| `--config` | `<file>` | Configuration file |
| `--color` |  | Only for the root command |

### Subcommands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| [`remote`](#repo-remote) | Manage remotes |
| [`branch`](#repo-branch) | Manage local branches |
| [`config`](#repo-config) | Read or write configuration |
| [`sync`](#repo-sync) | Synchronise with all remotes |

## `repo remote`

Manage remotes

Aliases: `r`  

```
repo remote [options] <command>
```

### Options

| Option | Value | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `--dry-run` |  | Show what would change |

### Inherited options

| Option | Value | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `--verbose`, `-v` |  | Print more |
| `--config` | `<file>` | Configuration file |

### Subcommands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| [`add`](#repo-remote-add) | Add a remote |
| [`list`](#repo-remote-list) | List remotes |
| [`set-url`](#repo-remote-set-url) | Change the URL of a remote |
| [`branch`](#repo-remote-branch) | Manage the branches of a remote |

## `repo remote add`

Add a remote

```
repo remote add [options] <name> <url>
```

### Options

| Option | Value | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `--fetch` |  | Fetch after adding |

### Inherited options

| Option | Value | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `--dry-run` |  | Show what would change |
| `--verbose`, `-v` |  | Print more |
| `--config` | `<file>` | Configuration file |

### Arguments

| Argument | Values | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `<name>` |  | Required. |
| `<url>` |  | Required. |

